Optimistic Execution with Implicit Confirmation: repeating the data back naturally while simultaneously processing it in the background, you get both: speed and data validation.

Vapi supports interruption handling (barge-in) natively. If the AI is speaking and the user talks over it, the AI instantly stops generating audio and listens to what the user is saying.

